T*
(##Choose Hybrid for v1-v2) Tj
T*
(1. Use vendor capabilities for high-friction ingestion/parsing where they are strongest.) Tj
T*
(2. Keep exception queue, workflow routing, and management reporting in your internal stack.) Tj
T*
(3. Preserve normalized internal data model so you can swap vendors later.) Tj
